    "updated_at": "2022-08-15T14:03:45Z",
    "body": "Hmmm, actually I think the current spec may be correct.\r\n\r\nIf the image is completely available, it will be in the \"list of available images\", and so step 6.3.7.1 restarts the animation. (This step is exercised by https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/pull/35468 )\r\n\r\nIf the image is still loading, the step here will restart the animation. I'm not sure if browsers *start* to animate images before they're completely loaded, though. This probably needs some more testing.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
    "reactions": {
      "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/whatwg/html/issues/comments/1215050645/reactions",
